window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c354-d8b5591c64d7129f.json"]={sha256:"d8b5591c64d7129f391aa6457ee1bd8ce4eecf7f4c28d8fc2dd849e7a4036e09",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-fb2d52756f35f162","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-pathfinder/","title":"Mars Pathfinder — NASA Science","titleEn":"Mars Pathfinder — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c354","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c354","related":[{"id":"c355","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-exploration-rovers-spirit-and-opportunity/"],"title":"Mars Exploration Rovers 火星車","titleEn":"Mars Exploration Rovers","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學滑移超過 0.30 時暫停路徑延伸，先區分地面滑移與視覺尺度錯誤。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Above teaching slip 0.30, pause route extension and distinguish terrain slip from visual-scale error. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"建立含固定生存負載與可延期科學活動的單日能量排程。","differenceEn":"Build a daily energy schedule separating survival loads from deferrable science.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學小車輪半徑 0.065 m，轉 10 圈，影像量得前進 3.2 m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：s=1−3.2/(2π×0.065×10)。 結果約 0.216468 fraction。滑移率 s=1−實際距離/輪周理論距離；僅適用前進且理論距離非零的段落。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成日獲能 700 Wh、固定能耗 380 Wh、保留 80 Wh、科學負載 60 W。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：t=(700−380−80)/60。 結果約 4 h。可用科學時間=(日獲能−固定能耗−保留量)/科學平均功率；不能以日平均掩蓋瞬間功率限制。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. A model rover has 0.065 m wheel radius, ten revolutions and 3.2 m visual displacement. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: s=1−3.2/(2π×0.065×10). Result ≈ 0.216468 fraction. Slip s=1−actual travel/wheel-implied travel applies to forward segments with nonzero wheel travel.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic daily harvest is 700 Wh, fixed demand 380 Wh, reserve 80 Wh and science demand 60 W. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: t=(700−380−80)/60. Result ≈ 4 h. Science time=(daily harvest−fixed energy−reserve)/science power; daily averages do not remove peak-power limits.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c364","referenceUrls":["https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/en/missions/spacecraft/past/hayabusa.html"],"title":"Hayabusa 小行星採樣","titleEn":"Hayabusa asteroid sample return","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學滑移超過 0.30 時暫停路徑延伸，先區分地面滑移與視覺尺度錯誤。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Above teaching slip 0.30, pause route extension and distinguish terrain slip from visual-scale error. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"由光學位置不確定度與接近速度估計一次接近的觀測更新需求。","differenceEn":"Estimate observation-update requirements from optical position uncertainty and approach speed.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學小車輪半徑 0.065 m，轉 10 圈，影像量得前進 3.2 m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：s=1−3.2/(2π×0.065×10)。 結果約 0.216468 fraction。滑移率 s=1−實際距離/輪周理論距離；僅適用前進且理論距離非零的段落。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成初始位置 1σ=2 m，速度誤差 0.01 m/s，預測 120 s。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：σ=sqrt(2²+(120×0.01)²)。 結果約 2.33238 m。不相關誤差下位置預測 σ=sqrt(σx²+(tσv)²)；假設短時等速且無交叉協方差。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. A model rover has 0.065 m wheel radius, ten revolutions and 3.2 m visual displacement. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: s=1−3.2/(2π×0.065×10). Result ≈ 0.216468 fraction. Slip s=1−actual travel/wheel-implied travel applies to forward segments with nonzero wheel travel.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic initial position 1σ is 2 m, velocity error 0.01 m/s and prediction horizon 120 s. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: σ=sqrt(2²+(120×0.01)²). Result ≈ 2.33238 m. For uncorrelated errors σ=sqrt(σx²+(tσv)²), assuming short-duration constant velocity and no cross covariance.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-d20ee063572f97df","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-exploration-rovers-spirit-and-opportunity/","title":"Mars Exploration Rovers — NASA Science","titleEn":"Mars Exploration Rovers — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-d39649be26535683","url":"https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/en/missions/spacecraft/past/hayabusa.html","title":"JAXA ISAS HAYABUSA","titleEn":"JAXA ISAS HAYABUSA","publisher":"JAXA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
